iginal song.\nI'll leave everything up to you, including facial expressions, clothing (preferably Japanese), composition, etc.!\nAs long as it fits the song.\nSince it is for a video, please use a video size of 16:9. We would appreciate it if you could also make a margin for the lyrics.\n\nPlease refer to the old model for the linked folder.\n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/44hj2ywz66giqhb/AAAAd-NPHi9QET19Y0fclcjMa?dl=0", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noa_yuzuri/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1845092, "client_id": 1047695, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fd7b66a3202d193dba48ebea83a0c35", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fd7b66a3202d193dba48ebea83a0c35, https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44fce9d4c21d1ecd42206fc8b9369362 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=570bdd8a7a73426a06b4a2af40c98272 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3674699dfa21cef55a94cf4ef9840b1d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3674699dfa21cef55a94cf4ef9840b1d, https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=85ee125c298b72fbd2802e5bc03bb07e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8750443a/uploads/origins/86ec4d7c-4665-4e13-8958-d28687b04152?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a2d94797aa986d0f6d8668e0559506ab 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is Mayo Minami ( https://twitter.com/MiNAMi_MAYO ), a private virtual streamer.\nI saw your beautiful illustration and I would like to request you to draw an illustration of yourself in the style of Yuzu Li Noa!\n\nYour request\nIllustration of Mayo Minami herself\nI would like to leave the composition, etc. to Yuzuri Noa.\nSize: 1920 x 1080, please.\nWe would appreciate it if the tips of hair and fingers are not cut off for use as thumbnails, etc.\n\nAbout the character design\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gai1rzsLtgQNvFS3GUhJlYPMPSp6nPsD?usp=sharing\nYou can find it here. We hope this will be helpful.\n\nUsage.\nPosting on social networking sites such as Twitter\nUse as thumbnails on the platforms (YouTube and Twitch) where you are currently active.\n\nOthers\nI would like the delivery to be in pdf format.\nWe would appreciate it if you could include a pdf of the person layer only, as it can be used for a variety of purposes.\nWhen you post on Twitter, we would appreciate it if you could tweet with the tag \"#Korekono kikimete Mayo-chan\".\n\nWe hope to have the opportunity to work with you.\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noa_yuzuri/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1845092, "client_id": 1196514, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aab0eb066a611547dd70dd00a39bfcd3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aab0eb066a611547dd70dd00a39bfcd3, https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3715d92b3488a4ad09068b0504b632a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d999e57af3f1bdd1422033557697df8e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=224a609750b983b655c4c8415848ccfe", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=224a609750b983b655c4c8415848ccfe, https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9bd6bb772f573706cc2c4944a907b2c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ceee9c0/uploads/origins/68b244c7-5eb9-4627-81cb-d0b21e00dd2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=813b2fdfb74cb9d653ca24f598e857f4 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. I'm Minato Ragi, and I'm a VTuber on YouTube.\nThank you for appealing to me!\nI'd love for you to draw an illustration of me as a Vtuber, so I've made a request!\n\n\nHow to use it\nI would be very happy if you could use my illustration as a thumbnail for your Youtube videos and on various SNS.\n\nFormat\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could deliver the background and characters separately.\nIt would be very helpful if you could deliver the data as PSD data.\n\nThank you very much for your cooperation.\n\n----------\n\nminato ragi)\nTwitter : https://twitter.com/minato_ragi\nYouTube : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC68G7CKwETqspxyNeMb7FiA\n\nAge : 20s\nHeight : About 160cm\nGender : Female\nAppearance : Elf ears, teardrops, and cocoons\nPhysique：slender\nPersonality: calm\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tDIAnWikV0AcyWAA9x2Gcf0mBNgiOsqu", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@noa_yuzuri/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1845092, "client_id": 86835, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cff5133c/uploads/origins/83889b1a-562a-4cb4-aaa7-7c76de88ee0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f685862ad15c884a39183278176528c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cff5133c/uploads/origins/83889b1a-562a-4cb4-aaa7-7c76de88ee0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f685862ad15c884a39183278176528c, https://si.imgix.net/cff5133c/uploads/origins/83889b1a-562a-4cb4-aaa7-7c76de88ee0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4e7b57482e9abb420fb358a8691bfba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cff5133c/uploads/origins/83889b1a-562a-4cb4-aaa7-7c76de88ee0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6a1607b67bcaece541d7c227358b059 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cff5133c/uploads/origins/83889b1a-562a-4cb4-aaa7-7c76de88ee0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d9981b013d28b25678c3f223300da29a", "srcset": "https://s